[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Redot Engine
GenericName=Game Engine
Comment=Multi-platform 2D and 3D game engine with a feature-rich editor
Comment[fr]=Moteur de jeu 2D et 3D multiplateforme avec un éditeur riche en fonctionnalités
Comment[ja]=多機能なエディタを備えたマルチプラットフォーム対応の2D・3Dゲームエンジン
Comment[zh_CN]=多平台 2D 和 3D 游戏引擎，带有功能丰富的编辑器
Exec=redot %f
Icon=org.redotengine.Redot
Terminal=false
MimeType=application/x-godot-project;
Categories=Development;IDE;
Keywords=redot;godot;game;engine;gdscript;2d;3d;
# Measured: on Wayland (the default here, since X11 is only a fallback) the
# editor window's app_id is org.redotengine.Editor and the project manager's is
# org.redotengine.ProjectManager; on X11 both use WM_CLASS "Redot". Match the
# editor, where most time is spent.
StartupWMClass=org.redotengine.Editor
